\p \v 14 \w Therefore|strong="H3651"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
