\s1 An Invasion from the North
\p \v 22 \w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w Behold|strong="H2009"\w*, \w an army|strong="H5971"\w* \w is coming|strong="H935"\w*
