\p \v 11 \w Thus|strong="H1836"\w* \w you are to tell|strong="H560"\w* them: “\w These gods|strong="H426"\w*, \w who|strong="H1768"\w* \w have made|strong="H5648"\w* \w neither|strong="H3809"\w* \w the heavens|strong="H8065"\w* \w nor the earth|strong="H778"\w*, \w will perish|strong="H7"\w* \w from this earth|strong="H772"\w* \w and from|strong="H4481"\w* \w under|strong="H8460"\w* \w these|strong="H429"\w* \w heavens|strong="H8065"\w*.”\f + \fr 10:11 \ft The original text of this verse is in Aramaic.\f*
