\s1 The Coming Captivity of Judah
\p \v 17 \w Gather up|strong="H622"\w* \w your belongings|strong="H3666"\w* \w from this land|strong="H776"\w*, \w you who live|strong="H3427"\w* \w under siege|strong="H4692"\w*. \v 18 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
