\c 14
\s1 Drought, Famine, Sword, and Plague
\p \v 1 \w This is the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w concerning|strong="H5921"\w* \w the drought|strong="H1226"\w*:
