\q1 \w Do not|strong="H408"\w* \w forsake us|strong="H5117"\w*!
\p \v 10 \w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w about this|strong="H2088"\w* \w people|strong="H5971"\w*:
