\p \v 27 \w But if|strong="H518"\w* \w you do not|strong="H3808"\w* \w listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to Me|strong="H413"\w* \w to keep|strong="H6942"\w* \w the Sabbath|strong="H7676"\w* \w day holy|strong="H3117"\w* \w by not|strong="H1115"\w* \w carrying|strong="H5375"\w* \w a load|strong="H4853"\w* \w while entering|strong="H935"\w* \w the gates|strong="H8179"\w* \w of Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w on the Sabbath|strong="H7676"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*, \w then I will kindle|strong="H3341"\w* \w an unquenchable|strong="H3518"\w* \w fire|strong="H784"\w* \w in its gates|strong="H8179"\w* \w to consume|strong="H398"\w* \w the citadels|strong="H759"\w* \w of Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*.’”
\c 18
\s1 The Potter and the Clay
\p \v 1 \w This is the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w from the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*: \v 2 “\w Go down|strong="H3381"\w* \w at once|strong="H6965"\w* \w to the potter’s|strong="H3335"\w* \w house|strong="H1004"\w*, \w and there|strong="H8033"\w* \w I will give you|strong="H8085"\w* \w My message|strong="H1697"\w*.”
\p \v 3 \w So I went down|strong="H3381"\w* \w to the potter’s|strong="H3335"\w* \w house|strong="H1004"\w* \w and saw him|strong="H2009"\w* \w working|strong="H6213"\w* \w at|strong="H5921"\w* \w the wheel|strong="H70"\w*. \v 4 \w But the vessel|strong="H3627"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w he|strong="H1931"\w* \w was shaping|strong="H6213"\w* \w from the clay|strong="H2563"\w* \w became flawed|strong="H7843"\w* \w in his|strong="H3335"\w* \w hand|strong="H3027"\w*; \w so he formed|strong="H6213"\w* \w it into another|strong="H312"\w* \w vessel|strong="H3627"\w*, \w as|strong="H834"\w* \w it seemed|strong="H5869"\w* \w best|strong="H3474"\w* \w for him|strong="H3335"\w* \w to do|strong="H6213"\w*.
\p \v 5 \w Then the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w*, \w saying|strong="H559"\w*, \v 6 “\w O house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w can|strong="H3201"\w* \w I not|strong="H3808"\w* \w treat|strong="H6213"\w* you \w as this|strong="H2088"\w* \w potter treats his clay|strong="H3335"\w*? \w Just|strong="H2009"\w* \w like clay|strong="H2563"\w* \w in the potter’s|strong="H3335"\w* \w hand|strong="H3027"\w*, \w so|strong="H3651"\w* \w are you|strong="H859"\w* \w in My hand|strong="H3027"\w*, \w O house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*.
\p \v 7 \w At any time|strong="H7281"\w* \w I might announce|strong="H1696"\w* \w that|strong="H5921"\w* \w a nation|strong="H1471"\w* \w or kingdom|strong="H4467"\w* \w will be uprooted|strong="H5428"\w*, \w torn down|strong="H5422"\w*, \w and destroyed|strong="H6"\w*. \v 8 \w But if that|strong="H1931"\w* \w nation|strong="H1471"\w* \w I warned|strong="H1696"\w* \w turns|strong="H7725"\w* \w from its evil|strong="H7451"\w*, \w then I will relent|strong="H5162"\w* \w of|strong="H5921"\w* \w the disaster|strong="H7451"\w* \w I had planned|strong="H2803"\w* \w to bring|strong="H6213"\w*.
\p \v 9 \w And if at another time|strong="H7281"\w* \w I announce|strong="H1696"\w* \w that I will build up|strong="H1129"\w* \w and establish|strong="H5193"\w* \w a nation|strong="H1471"\w* \w or kingdom|strong="H4467"\w*, \v 10 \w and if it does|strong="H6213"\w* \w evil|strong="H7451"\w* \w in My sight|strong="H5869"\w* \w and does not|strong="H1115"\w* \w listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to My voice|strong="H6963"\w*, \w then I will relent|strong="H5162"\w* \w of|strong="H5921"\w* \w the good|strong="H2896"\w* \w I had intended for it|strong="H559"\w*.
