\p \v 12 \w But they will reply|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w It is hopeless|strong="H2976"\w*. \w We will follow|strong="H1980"\w* \w our own plans|strong="H4284"\w*, \w and each of us|strong="H376"\w* \w will act|strong="H6213"\w* \w according to the stubbornness|strong="H8307"\w* \w of his evil|strong="H7451"\w* \w heart|strong="H3820"\w*.’”
\p \v 13 \w Therefore|strong="H3651"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
