\p \v 1 \w When Pashhur|strong="H6583"\w* \w the priest|strong="H3548"\w*, \w the son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Immer|strong="H564"\w* \w and the chief|strong="H5057"\w* \w official|strong="H6496"\w* \w in the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w heard|strong="H8085"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w prophesying|strong="H5012"\w* \w these|strong="H428"\w* \w things|strong="H1697"\w*, \v 2 \w he|strong="H6583"\w* \w had Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w beaten|strong="H5221"\w* \w and put|strong="H5414"\w* \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w the stocks|strong="H4115"\w* \w at the Upper|strong="H5945"\w* \w Gate|strong="H8179"\w* \w of Benjamin|strong="H1144"\w*, \w which was|strong="H834"\w* \w by the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.
\p \v 3 \w The next day|strong="H4283"\w*, \w when Pashhur|strong="H6583"\w* \w released|strong="H3318"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the stocks|strong="H4115"\w*, \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w* \w to him|strong="H413"\w*, “\w The LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w does not|strong="H3808"\w* \w call|strong="H7121"\w* \w you Pashhur|strong="H6583"\w*, \w but|strong="H3588"\w* \w Magor-missabib|strong="H4036"\w*.\f + \fr 20:3 \fqa Magor-missabib \ft means \fqa terror on every side \ft or \fqa the man who lives in terror\ft .\f* \v 4 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*: ‘\w I will make you|strong="H5414"\w* \w a terror|strong="H4032"\w* to yourself \w and to all|strong="H3605"\w* \w your friends|strong="H157"\w*. \w They will fall|strong="H5307"\w* \w by the sword|strong="H2719"\w* \w of their enemies|strong="H341"\w* \w before your very eyes|strong="H5869"\w*. \w And I will hand Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w over to|strong="H5414"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H894"\w*, \w and he will carry them away|strong="H1540"\w* \w to Babylon|strong="H894"\w* \w and put them|strong="H5221"\w* \w to the sword|strong="H2719"\w*. \v 5 \w I will give away|strong="H5414"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the wealth|strong="H2633"\w* \w of this|strong="H2063"\w* \w city|strong="H5892"\w* — \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w its products|strong="H3018"\w* \w and valuables|strong="H3366"\w*, \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the treasures|strong="H214"\w* \w of the kings|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* — \w to|strong="H3027"\w* \w their enemies|strong="H341"\w*. \w They will plunder them|strong="H962"\w*, \w seize them|strong="H3947"\w*, \w and carry them off|strong="H935"\w* \w to Babylon|strong="H894"\w*. \v 6 \w And you|strong="H859"\w*, \w Pashhur|strong="H6583"\w*, \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w who live|strong="H3427"\w* \w in your house|strong="H1004"\w*, \w will go|strong="H1980"\w* \w into captivity|strong="H7628"\w*. \w You will go|strong="H935"\w* \w to Babylon|strong="H894"\w*, \w and there|strong="H8033"\w* \w you will die|strong="H4191"\w* \w and|strong="H8033"\w* \w be buried|strong="H6912"\w* — \w you|strong="H859"\w* \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w your friends|strong="H157"\w* \w to whom|strong="H834"\w* \w you have prophesied|strong="H5012"\w* these \w lies|strong="H8267"\w*.’”
