\q1 \v 11 “\w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w both|strong="H1571"\w* \w prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w and|strong="H1571"\w* \w priest|strong="H3548"\w* \w are ungodly|strong="H2610"\w*;
