\q2 \w the people of Jerusalem|strong="H3427"\w* \w are like Gomorrah|strong="H6017"\w*.”
\p \v 15 \w Therefore|strong="H3651"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w concerning|strong="H5921"\w* \w the prophets|strong="H5030"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w I will feed|strong="H398"\w* \w them|strong="H853"\w* \w wormwood|strong="H3939"\w*
\q2 \w and give them poisoned|strong="H7219"\w* \w water|strong="H4325"\w* \w to drink|strong="H8248"\w*,
