\q2 \w ungodliness|strong="H2613"\w* \w has spread|strong="H3318"\w* \w throughout the land|strong="H776"\w*.”
\p \v 16 \w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w Do not|strong="H408"\w* \w listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the prophets|strong="H5030"\w* \w who prophesy|strong="H5012"\w* to you.
\q2 \w They are filling you with false hopes|strong="H1891"\w*.
\q1 \w They speak|strong="H1696"\w* \w visions|strong="H2377"\w* \w from their own minds|strong="H3820"\w*,
\q2 \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w from the mouth|strong="H6310"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.
