\s1 A Warning to the Cities of Judah
\p \v 1 \w At the beginning|strong="H7225"\w* \w of the reign|strong="H4468"\w* \w of Jehoiakim|strong="H3079"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Josiah|strong="H2977"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w*, \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w word|strong="H1697"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w from the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*: \v 2 “\w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*: \w Stand|strong="H5975"\w* \w in the courtyard|strong="H2691"\w* \w of the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w and speak|strong="H1696"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w I have commanded|strong="H6680"\w* \w you to speak|strong="H1696"\w* \w to all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the cities|strong="H5892"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w who come|strong="H935"\w* \w to worship|strong="H7812"\w* \w there|strong="H1004"\w*. \w Do not|strong="H408"\w* \w omit|strong="H1639"\w* \w a word|strong="H1697"\w*. \v 3 \w Perhaps|strong="H194"\w* \w they will listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w and turn|strong="H7725"\w*— \w each|strong="H376"\w* \w from his evil|strong="H7451"\w* \w way of life|strong="H1870"\w*— \w so that I may relent|strong="H5162"\w* \w of|strong="H413"\w* \w the disaster|strong="H7451"\w* \w I|strong="H595"\w* \w am planning|strong="H2803"\w* \w to bring|strong="H6213"\w* upon them \w because of|strong="H6440"\w* \w the evil|strong="H7455"\w* \w of their deeds|strong="H4611"\w*.
\p \v 4 \w And you are to tell them|strong="H559"\w* \w that|strong="H413"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*: ‘\w If|strong="H518"\w* \w you do not|strong="H3808"\w* \w listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to Me|strong="H413"\w* \w and walk|strong="H1980"\w* \w in My law|strong="H8451"\w*, \w which|strong="H834"\w* \w I have set|strong="H5414"\w* \w before you|strong="H6440"\w*, \v 5 \w and if you do not listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w of My servants|strong="H5650"\w* \w the prophets|strong="H5030"\w*, \w whom|strong="H834"\w* \w I|strong="H595"\w* \w have sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w you|strong="H413"\w* \w again|strong="H7925"\w* \w and again|strong="H7971"\w*\f + \fr 26:5 \ft Literally \fqa I have sent you, rising up early and sending (them),\f* \w even though you did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w listen|strong="H8085"\w*, \v 6 \w then I will make|strong="H5414"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w house|strong="H1004"\w* \w like Shiloh|strong="H7887"\w*, \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w I will make|strong="H5414"\w* \w this|strong="H2063"\w* \w city|strong="H5892"\w* \w an object of cursing|strong="H7045"\w* \w among all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the nations|strong="H1471"\w* \w of the earth|strong="H776"\w*.’”
\s1 Jeremiah Threatened with Death
