\p \w At this, Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w went|strong="H1980"\w* \w on his way|strong="H1870"\w*. \v 12 \w But shortly after|strong="H310"\w* \w Hananiah|strong="H2608"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w had broken|strong="H7665"\w* \w the yoke|strong="H4133"\w* \w off|strong="H5921"\w* \w his neck|strong="H6677"\w*, \w the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w*: \v 13 “\w Go|strong="H1980"\w* \w and tell|strong="H559"\w* \w Hananiah|strong="H2608"\w* \w that this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*: ‘\w You have broken|strong="H7665"\w* \w a yoke|strong="H4133"\w* \w of wood|strong="H6086"\w*, \w but in its place|strong="H8478"\w* \w you have fashioned|strong="H6213"\w* \w a yoke|strong="H4133"\w* \w of iron|strong="H1270"\w*.’
\p \v 14 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w says|strong="H559"\w*: ‘\w I have put|strong="H5414"\w* \w a yoke|strong="H5923"\w* \w of iron|strong="H1270"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w the neck|strong="H6677"\w* \w of all|strong="H3605"\w* \w these|strong="H428"\w* \w nations|strong="H1471"\w* \w to make them serve|strong="H5647"\w* \w Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H5019"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H894"\w*, \w and they will serve him|strong="H5647"\w*. \w I have even|strong="H1571"\w* \w given him control|strong="H5414"\w* \w of the beasts|strong="H2416"\w* \w of the field|strong="H7704"\w*.’”
\p \v 15 \w Then the prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w Hananiah|strong="H2608"\w*, “\w Listen|strong="H8085"\w*, \w Hananiah|strong="H2608"\w*! \w The LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w send you|strong="H7971"\w*, \w but you|strong="H859"\w* \w have persuaded|strong="H2088"\w* \w this people|strong="H5971"\w* \w to trust|strong="H982"\w* \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w a lie|strong="H8267"\w*. \v 16 \w Therefore|strong="H3651"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*: ‘\w I am about to remove you|strong="H7971"\w* \w from|strong="H5921"\w* \w the face|strong="H6440"\w* \w of the earth|strong="H127"\w*. \w You|strong="H859"\w* \w will die|strong="H4191"\w* \w this year|strong="H8141"\w* \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w you have preached|strong="H1696"\w* \w rebellion|strong="H5627"\w* \w against|strong="H413"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.’”
\p \v 17 \w And in the seventh|strong="H7637"\w* \w month|strong="H2320"\w* \w of that very|strong="H1931"\w* \w year|strong="H8141"\w*, \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w Hananiah|strong="H2608"\w* \w died|strong="H4191"\w*.
\c 29
\s1 Jeremiah’s Letter to the Exiles
\p \v 1 \w This|strong="H428"\w* \w is the text|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the letter|strong="H5612"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w from Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the surviving|strong="H3499"\w* \w elders|strong="H2205"\w* \w among the exiles|strong="H1473"\w* \w and to|strong="H413"\w* \w the priests|strong="H3548"\w*, \w the prophets|strong="H5030"\w*, \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the others|strong="H5971"\w* \w Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H5019"\w* \w had carried into exile|strong="H1540"\w* \w from Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w to Babylon|strong="H894"\w*. \v 2 (\w This was after|strong="H310"\w* \w King|strong="H4428"\w* \w Jeconiah|strong="H3204"\w*,\f + \fr 29:2 \fqa Jeconiah \ft is a variant of \fqa Jehoiachin\ft ; see \ref 2 Kings 24:12|2KI 24:12\ref*.\f* \w the queen mother|strong="H1377"\w*, \w the court officials|strong="H5631"\w*, \w the officials|strong="H8269"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w and Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*, \w the craftsmen|strong="H2796"\w*, \w and the metalsmiths|strong="H4525"\w* \w had been exiled|strong="H3318"\w* \w from Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*.) \v 3 \w The letter was entrusted to|strong="H3027"\w* \w Elasah|strong="H501"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Shaphan|strong="H8227"\w* \w and Gemariah|strong="H1587"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Hilkiah|strong="H2518"\w*, \w whom|strong="H834"\w* \w Zedekiah|strong="H6667"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w King|strong="H4428"\w* \w Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H5019"\w* \w in Babylon|strong="H894"\w*. \w It stated|strong="H559"\w*:
\pmo \v 4 \w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w to all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the exiles|strong="H1473"\w* \w who were carried away|strong="H1540"\w* \w from Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w to Babylon|strong="H894"\w*: \v 5 “\w Build|strong="H1129"\w* \w houses|strong="H1004"\w* \w and settle down|strong="H3427"\w*. \w Plant|strong="H5193"\w* \w gardens|strong="H1593"\w* \w and eat|strong="H398"\w* \w their produce|strong="H6529"\w*. \v 6 \w Take|strong="H3947"\w* \w wives|strong="H802"\w* \w and have|strong="H3205"\w* \w sons|strong="H1121"\w* \w and daughters|strong="H1323"\w*. \w Take|strong="H3947"\w* \w wives|strong="H802"\w* \w for your sons|strong="H1121"\w* \w and give|strong="H5414"\w* \w your daughters|strong="H1323"\w* \w in marriage|strong="H582"\w*, \w so that they too may have|strong="H3205"\w* \w sons|strong="H1121"\w* \w and daughters|strong="H1323"\w*. \w Multiply|strong="H7235"\w* \w there|strong="H8033"\w*; \w do not|strong="H408"\w* \w decrease|strong="H4591"\w*. \v 7 \w Seek|strong="H1875"\w* \w the prosperity|strong="H7965"\w* \w of the city|strong="H5892"\w* \w to which|strong="H834"\w* \w I have sent you as exiles|strong="H1540"\w*. \w Pray|strong="H6419"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w on its behalf|strong="H1157"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w if it prospers|strong="H7965"\w*, you too \w will prosper|strong="H7965"\w*.”
\pmo \v 8 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w says|strong="H559"\w*: “\w Do not|strong="H408"\w* \w be deceived|strong="H5377"\w* \w by the prophets|strong="H5030"\w* \w and diviners|strong="H7080"\w* \w among you|strong="H7130"\w*, \w and do not|strong="H408"\w* \w listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the dreams|strong="H2472"\w* \w you elicit from them|strong="H859"\w*. \v 9 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w they|strong="H1992"\w* \w are falsely prophesying|strong="H5012"\w* to you \w in My name|strong="H8034"\w*; \w I have not|strong="H3808"\w* \w sent them|strong="H7971"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.”\f + \fr 29:9 \ft Some translators close the written portion of this letter later in the chapter.\f*
\p \v 10 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*: “\w When|strong="H3588"\w* \w Babylon’s|strong="H894"\w* \w seventy|strong="H7657"\w* \w years|strong="H8141"\w* \w are complete|strong="H4390"\w*, \w I will attend to|strong="H6485"\w* \w you|strong="H853"\w* \w and confirm|strong="H6965"\w* \w My promise|strong="H1697"\w* \w to restore|strong="H7725"\w* \w you|strong="H853"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w place|strong="H4725"\w*. \v 11 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w I|strong="H595"\w* \w know|strong="H3045"\w* \w the plans|strong="H4284"\w* \w I|strong="H595"\w* \w have|strong="H2803"\w* \w for you|strong="H5921"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w plans|strong="H4284"\w* \w to prosper you|strong="H7965"\w* \w and not|strong="H3808"\w* \w to harm you|strong="H7451"\w*, \w to give|strong="H5414"\w* you \w a future|strong="H319"\w* \w and a hope|strong="H8615"\w*. \v 12 \w Then you will call|strong="H7121"\w* \w upon Me|strong="H853"\w* \w and come|strong="H1980"\w* \w and pray|strong="H6419"\w* \w to Me|strong="H413"\w*, \w and I will listen|strong="H8085"\w* \w to you|strong="H413"\w*. \v 13 \w You will seek|strong="H1245"\w* \w Me|strong="H853"\w* \w and find Me|strong="H4672"\w* \w when|strong="H3588"\w* \w you search for Me|strong="H1875"\w* \w with all|strong="H3605"\w* \w your heart|strong="H3824"\w*. \v 14 \w I will be found|strong="H4672"\w* by you, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w and I will restore you|strong="H7725"\w* \w from captivity|strong="H7622"\w*\f + \fr 29:14 \ft Or \fqa restore your fortunes\f* \w and gather|strong="H6908"\w* \w you|strong="H853"\w* \w from all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the nations|strong="H1471"\w* \w and places|strong="H4725"\w* \w to which|strong="H834"\w* \w I have banished you|strong="H5080"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*. \w I will restore|strong="H7725"\w* \w you to|strong="H413"\w* \w the place|strong="H4725"\w* \w from which|strong="H834"\w* \w I sent|strong="H1540"\w* \w you|strong="H853"\w* \w into exile|strong="H8033"\w*.”
\p \v 15 \w Because|strong="H3588"\w* \w you may say|strong="H559"\w*, “\w The LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w has raised up|strong="H6965"\w* for us \w prophets|strong="H5030"\w* \w in Babylon|strong="H894"\w*,” \v 16 \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w about|strong="H413"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w who sits|strong="H3427"\w* \w on|strong="H413"\w* \w David’s|strong="H1732"\w* \w throne|strong="H3678"\w* \w and|strong="H413"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w who remain|strong="H3427"\w* \w in this|strong="H2063"\w* \w city|strong="H5892"\w*, \w your brothers|strong="H251"\w* \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w go|strong="H3318"\w* \w with you|strong="H854"\w* \w into exile|strong="H1473"\w*— \v 17 \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
\p “\w I will send|strong="H7971"\w* against them \w sword|strong="H2719"\w* \w and famine|strong="H7458"\w* \w and plague|strong="H1698"\w*, \w and I will make|strong="H5414"\w* \w them|strong="H853"\w* \w like rotten|strong="H8182"\w* \w figs|strong="H8384"\w*, \w so bad|strong="H7455"\w* \w they cannot|strong="H3808"\w* \w be eaten|strong="H398"\w*. \v 18 \w I will pursue|strong="H7291"\w* \w them|strong="H310"\w* \w with sword|strong="H2719"\w* \w and famine|strong="H7458"\w* \w and plague|strong="H1698"\w*. \w I will make them|strong="H5414"\w* \w a horror|strong="H2113"\w* \w to all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the kingdoms|strong="H4467"\w* \w of the earth|strong="H776"\w*— \w a curse|strong="H423"\w*, \w a desolation|strong="H8047"\w*, \w and an object of scorn|strong="H8322"\w* \w and reproach|strong="H2781"\w* \w among all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the nations|strong="H1471"\w* \w to which|strong="H834"\w* \w I banish them|strong="H5080"\w*. \v 19 \w I will do this because|strong="H8478"\w* \w they have not|strong="H3808"\w* \w listened|strong="H8085"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w My words|strong="H1697"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*,\w which|strong="H834"\w* \w I sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w them|strong="H853"\w* \w again and again|strong="H7925"\w*\f + \fr 29:19 \ft Literally \fqa I sent to them, rising up early and sending (to them)\f* \w through My servants|strong="H5650"\w* \w the prophets|strong="H5030"\w*. \w And neither have you exiles|strong="H3808"\w* \w listened|strong="H8085"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.”
\p \v 20 \w So hear|strong="H8085"\w* \w the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w you exiles|strong="H1473"\w* \w I have sent away|strong="H7971"\w* \w from Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w to Babylon|strong="H894"\w*. \v 21 \w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w about|strong="H413"\w* \w Ahab|strong="H256"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Kolaiah|strong="H6964"\w* \w and|strong="H413"\w* \w Zedekiah|strong="H6667"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Maaseiah|strong="H4641"\w*, \w who are prophesying|strong="H5012"\w* to you \w lies|strong="H8267"\w* \w in My name|strong="H8034"\w*: “\w I will deliver|strong="H5414"\w* \w them|strong="H853"\w* \w to|strong="H3027"\w* \w Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H5019"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H894"\w*, \w and he will kill them|strong="H5221"\w* \w before your very eyes|strong="H5869"\w*. \v 22 \w Because|strong="H3947"\w* of them, \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the exiles|strong="H1546"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w are in Babylon|strong="H894"\w* \w will use this curse|strong="H7045"\w*: ‘\w May the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w make|strong="H7760"\w* \w you like Zedekiah|strong="H6667"\w* \w and Ahab|strong="H256"\w*, \w whom|strong="H834"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H894"\w* \w roasted|strong="H7033"\w* \w in the fire|strong="H784"\w*!’ \v 23 \w For|strong="H3282"\w* \w they have committed|strong="H6213"\w* \w an outrage|strong="H5039"\w* \w in Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w by committing adultery|strong="H5003"\w* \w with|strong="H853"\w* \w the wives|strong="H802"\w* \w of their neighbors|strong="H7453"\w* \w and speaking|strong="H1696"\w* \w lies|strong="H8267"\w* \w in My name|strong="H8034"\w*, \w which|strong="H834"\w* \w I did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w command them to do|strong="H6680"\w*. \w I|strong="H595"\w* \w am He who knows|strong="H1931"\w*, \w and I am a witness|strong="H5707"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.”
\s1 The Message to Shemaiah
\p \v 24 \w You are to tell|strong="H559"\w* \w Shemaiah|strong="H8098"\w* \w the Nehelamite|strong="H5161"\w* \w that|strong="H559"\w* \v 25 \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w says|strong="H559"\w*: “\w In your own name|strong="H8034"\w* \w you|strong="H859"\w* \w have sent out|strong="H7971"\w* \w letters|strong="H5612"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w of Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*, \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the priest|strong="H3548"\w* \w Zephaniah|strong="H6846"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Maaseiah|strong="H4641"\w*, \w and to|strong="H413"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the priests|strong="H3548"\w*. \w You said to Zephaniah|strong="H559"\w*:\f + \fr 29:25 \ft Hebrew \fqa You said\ft ; the addressee \fqa Zephaniah \ft is added for clarity.\f*
\pmo \v 26 ‘\w The LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w has appointed|strong="H5414"\w* \w you priest|strong="H3548"\w* \w in place of|strong="H8478"\w* \w Jehoiada|strong="H3077"\w*, \w to be|strong="H1961"\w* \w the chief officer|strong="H6496"\w* \w in the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w responsible for any|strong="H3605"\w* \w madman|strong="H376"\w* \w who acts like a prophet|strong="H5012"\w* — \w you must put|strong="H5414"\w* \w him|strong="H853"\w* \w in|strong="H413"\w* \w stocks|strong="H4115"\w* \w and neck irons|strong="H6729"\w*. \v 27 \w So now|strong="H6258"\w*, \w why|strong="H4100"\w* \w have you not|strong="H3808"\w* \w rebuked|strong="H1605"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w of Anathoth|strong="H6069"\w*, \w who poses as a prophet|strong="H5012"\w* among you? \v 28 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w he has sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w to us|strong="H413"\w* \w in Babylon|strong="H894"\w*, \w claiming|strong="H559"\w*: \w Since the exile|strong="H1931"\w* \w will be lengthy|strong="H752"\w*, \w build|strong="H1129"\w* \w houses|strong="H1004"\w* \w and settle down|strong="H3427"\w*; \w plant|strong="H5193"\w* \w gardens|strong="H1593"\w* \w and eat|strong="H398"\w* \w their produce|strong="H6529"\w*.’”
\p \v 29 (\w Zephaniah|strong="H6846"\w* \w the priest|strong="H3548"\w*, \w however, had read|strong="H7121"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w letter|strong="H5612"\w* \w to|strong="H241"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w*.)
\p \v 30 \w Then the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w*: \v 31 “\w Send|strong="H7971"\w* \w a message|strong="H5921"\w* \w telling|strong="H559"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the exiles|strong="H1473"\w* \w what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w concerning|strong="H413"\w* \w Shemaiah|strong="H8098"\w* \w the Nehelamite|strong="H5161"\w*. \w Because|strong="H3282"\w* \w Shemaiah|strong="H8098"\w* \w has prophesied|strong="H5012"\w* to you— \w though I|strong="H589"\w* \w did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w send him|strong="H7971"\w*— \w and has made you trust|strong="H982"\w* \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w a lie|strong="H8267"\w*, \v 32 \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*: ‘\w I will surely punish|strong="H6485"\w* \w Shemaiah|strong="H8098"\w* \w the Nehelamite|strong="H5161"\w* \w and his descendants|strong="H2233"\w*. \w He will have|strong="H1961"\w* \w no|strong="H3808"\w* \w one|strong="H376"\w* \w left|strong="H3427"\w* \w among|strong="H8432"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w people|strong="H5971"\w*, \w nor|strong="H3808"\w* \w will he see|strong="H7200"\w* \w the good|strong="H2896"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w will bring|strong="H6213"\w* \w to My people|strong="H5971"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w he has preached|strong="H1696"\w* \w rebellion|strong="H5627"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.’”
\c 30
\s1 The Restoration of Israel and Judah
\r (\ref Ezekiel 28:25–26|EZK 28:25-26\ref*)
\p \v 1 \w This is the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w from|strong="H854"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*: \v 2 “\w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w says|strong="H559"\w*: ‘\w Write|strong="H3789"\w* \w in|strong="H413"\w* \w a book|strong="H5612"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w I have spoken|strong="H1696"\w* \w to you|strong="H413"\w*. \v 3 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w behold|strong="H2009"\w*, \w the days|strong="H3117"\w* \w are coming|strong="H935"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w when I will restore|strong="H7725"\w* \w from captivity|strong="H7622"\w*\f + \fr 30:3 \ft Or \fqa restore the fortunes of\f* \w My people|strong="H5971"\w* \w Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w and Judah|strong="H3063"\w*, \w declares|strong="H559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*. \w I will restore them|strong="H7725"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w I gave|strong="H5414"\w* \w to their fathers|strong="H1"\w*, \w and they will possess it|strong="H3423"\w*.’”
\p \v 4 \w These|strong="H428"\w* \w are the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w spoke|strong="H1696"\w* \w concerning|strong="H413"\w* \w Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w and Judah|strong="H3063"\w*. \v 5 \w Yes|strong="H3588"\w*, \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w A cry|strong="H6963"\w* \w of panic|strong="H2731"\w* \w is heard|strong="H8085"\w* —
\q2 \w a cry of terror|strong="H6343"\w*, \w not|strong="H369"\w* \w of peace|strong="H7965"\w*.
\q1 \v 6 \w Ask|strong="H7592"\w* \w now|strong="H4994"\w*, \w and see|strong="H7200"\w*:
\q2 \w Can|strong="H518"\w* \w a male|strong="H2145"\w* \w give birth|strong="H3205"\w*?
\q1 \w Why then|strong="H4069"\w* \w do I see|strong="H7200"\w* \w every|strong="H3605"\w* \w man|strong="H1397"\w*
\q2 \w with his hands|strong="H3027"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w his stomach|strong="H2504"\w* \w like a woman in labor|strong="H3205"\w*
\q2 \w and every|strong="H3605"\w* \w face|strong="H6440"\w* \w turned|strong="H2015"\w* \w pale|strong="H3420"\w*?
\q1 \v 7 \w How|strong="H3588"\w* \w awful|strong="H1945"\w* \w that|strong="H1931"\w* \w day will be|strong="H3117"\w*!
\q2 \w None will be|strong="H369"\w* \w like it|strong="H3644"\w*!
\q1 \w It is|strong="H1931"\w* \w the time|strong="H6256"\w* \w of Jacob’s|strong="H3290"\w* \w distress|strong="H6869"\w*,
\q2 \w but he will be saved|strong="H3467"\w* \w out of it|strong="H4480"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \w On that|strong="H1931"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*,
\q2 \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*,
\q1 \w I will break|strong="H7665"\w* \w the yoke|strong="H5923"\w* \w off|strong="H5921"\w* \w their necks|strong="H6677"\w*
\q2 \w and tear off|strong="H5423"\w* \w their bonds|strong="H4147"\w*,
\q2 \w and no|strong="H3808"\w* \w longer|strong="H5750"\w* \w will strangers|strong="H2114"\w* \w enslave|strong="H5647"\w* them.
\q1 \v 9 \w Instead, they will serve|strong="H5647"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w their God|strong="H430"\w*
\q2 \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w David|strong="H1732"\w* \w their king|strong="H4428"\w*,
\q2 \w whom|strong="H834"\w* \w I will raise up|strong="H6965"\w* for them.
\b 
\q1 \v 10 \w As for you|strong="H859"\w*, \w O Jacob|strong="H3290"\w* \w My servant|strong="H5650"\w*, \w do not|strong="H408"\w* \w be afraid|strong="H3372"\w*,
\q2 \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*,
\q1 \w and do not|strong="H408"\w* \w be dismayed|strong="H2865"\w*,
