\p \v 26 \w At|strong="H5921"\w* \w this|strong="H2063"\w* \w I awoke|strong="H6974"\w* \w and looked around|strong="H7200"\w*. \w My sleep|strong="H8142"\w* \w had been most pleasant|strong="H6149"\w* to me.
\p \v 27 “\w The days|strong="H3117"\w* \w are coming|strong="H935"\w*,” \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, “\w when I will sow|strong="H2232"\w* \w the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w and the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w with the seed|strong="H2233"\w* \w of man|strong="H120"\w* \w and|strong="H2233"\w* \w of beast|strong="H929"\w*. \v 28 \w Just as|strong="H834"\w* \w I watched|strong="H8245"\w* \w over them|strong="H5921"\w* \w to uproot|strong="H5428"\w* \w and tear down|strong="H5422"\w*, \w to demolish|strong="H2040"\w*, \w destroy|strong="H6"\w*, \w and bring disaster|strong="H7489"\w*, \w so|strong="H3651"\w* \w I will watch|strong="H8245"\w* \w over them|strong="H5921"\w* \w to build|strong="H1129"\w* \w and to plant|strong="H5193"\w*,” \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.
\p \v 29 “\w In those|strong="H1992"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w*, \w it will no|strong="H3808"\w* \w longer|strong="H5750"\w* \w be said|strong="H559"\w*:
