\p \v 38 “\w The days|strong="H3117"\w* \w are coming|strong="H2009"\w*,”\f + \fr 31:38 \ft Literally \fqa Behold, the days\ft ; alternate MT reading \fqa Behold, the days are coming\f* \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, “\w when this city|strong="H5892"\w* \w will be rebuilt|strong="H1129"\w* \w for Me|strong="H3068"\w*, \w from the tower|strong="H4026"\w* \w of Hananel|strong="H2606"\w* \w to the Corner|strong="H6438"\w* \w Gate|strong="H8179"\w*. \v 39 \w The measuring|strong="H4060"\w* \w line|strong="H6961"\w* \w will once again|strong="H5750"\w* \w stretch out|strong="H3318"\w* \w straight|strong="H5048"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w the hill|strong="H1389"\w* \w of Gareb|strong="H1619"\w* \w and then turn|strong="H5437"\w* \w toward Goah|strong="H1601"\w*. \v 40 \w The whole|strong="H3605"\w* \w valley|strong="H6010"\w* \w of the dead bodies|strong="H6297"\w* \w and ashes|strong="H1880"\w*, \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the fields|strong="H8309"\w* \w as|strong="H5704"\w* \w far as the Kidron|strong="H6939"\w* \w Valley|strong="H5158"\w*, \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w the corner|strong="H6438"\w* \w of the Horse|strong="H5483"\w* \w Gate|strong="H8179"\w* \w to the east|strong="H4217"\w*, \w will be holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w to the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*. \w It will never|strong="H3808"\w* \w again|strong="H5750"\w* \w be uprooted|strong="H5428"\w* \w or demolished|strong="H2040"\w*.”
\c 32
\s1 Jeremiah Buys Hanamel’s Field
\p \v 1 \w This is the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w from the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w in the tenth|strong="H6224"\w* \w year|strong="H8141"\w* \w of Zedekiah|strong="H6667"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w*, \w which|strong="H1931"\w* \w was the eighteenth|strong="H8083"\w* \w year|strong="H8141"\w* \w of Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H5019"\w*. \v 2 \w At that time|strong="H227"\w* \w the army|strong="H2428"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H894"\w* \w was besieging|strong="H6696"\w* \w Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*, \w and Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w* \w was|strong="H1961"\w* \w imprisoned|strong="H3607"\w* \w in the courtyard|strong="H2691"\w* \w of the guard|strong="H4307"\w*, \w which was|strong="H834"\w* \w in the palace|strong="H1004"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w*.
\p \v 3 \w For|strong="H834"\w* \w Zedekiah|strong="H6667"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w had imprisoned him|strong="H3607"\w*, \w saying|strong="H559"\w*: “\w Why|strong="H4069"\w* \w are you|strong="H859"\w* \w prophesying|strong="H5012"\w* \w like this|strong="H3541"\w*? \w You claim that|strong="H559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w Behold|strong="H2005"\w*, \w I am about to deliver|strong="H5414"\w* \w this|strong="H2063"\w* \w city|strong="H5892"\w* \w into the hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H894"\w*, \w and he will capture it|strong="H3920"\w*. \v 4 \w Zedekiah|strong="H6667"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w* \w will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w escape|strong="H4422"\w* \w from the hands|strong="H3027"\w* \w of the Chaldeans|strong="H3778"\w*,\f + \fr 32:4 \ft That is, the Babylonians; also in verses 5, 24, 25, 28, 29, and 43\f* \w but|strong="H3588"\w* \w he will surely be delivered|strong="H5414"\w* \w into the hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H894"\w*, \w and will speak with him|strong="H1696"\w* \w face|strong="H6310"\w* \w to|strong="H5973"\w* \w face|strong="H6310"\w* \w and see him|strong="H7200"\w* \w eye|strong="H5869"\w* \w to eye|strong="H5869"\w*. \v 5 \w He will take|strong="H1980"\w* \w Zedekiah|strong="H6667"\w* \w to Babylon|strong="H894"\w*, \w where|strong="H8033"\w* \w he will stay|strong="H1961"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w I attend to|strong="H6485"\w* \w him|strong="H853"\w*, \w declares|strong="H5002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*. \w If|strong="H3588"\w* \w you fight|strong="H3898"\w* \w against|strong="H854"\w* \w the Chaldeans|strong="H3778"\w*, \w you will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w succeed|strong="H6743"\w*.’”
\p \v 6 \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w replied|strong="H559"\w*, “\w The word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w*, \w saying|strong="H559"\w*: \v 7 \w Behold|strong="H2009"\w*! \w Hanamel|strong="H2601"\w*, \w the son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of your uncle|strong="H1730"\w* \w Shallum|strong="H7967"\w*, \w is coming|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w you to say|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w Buy|strong="H7069"\w* for yourself \w my field|strong="H7704"\w* \w in Anathoth|strong="H6068"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* you have \w the right|strong="H4941"\w* \w of redemption|strong="H1353"\w* \w to buy it|strong="H7069"\w*.’ \v 8 \w Then, as the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w had said|strong="H1697"\w*, \w my cousin|strong="H1121"\w* \w Hanamel|strong="H2601"\w* \w came|strong="H935"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w* \w in the courtyard|strong="H2691"\w* \w of the guard|strong="H4307"\w* \w and urged me|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w Please|strong="H4994"\w* \w buy|strong="H7069"\w* \w my field|strong="H7704"\w* \w in Anathoth|strong="H6068"\w* \w in the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Benjamin|strong="H1144"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* you own \w the right|strong="H4941"\w* \w of inheritance|strong="H3425"\w* and \w redemption|strong="H1353"\w*. \w Buy it|strong="H7069"\w* for yourself.’”
\p \w Then I knew|strong="H3045"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w this|strong="H1931"\w* \w was the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.
\p \v 9 \w So I bought|strong="H7069"\w* \w the field|strong="H7704"\w* \w in Anathoth|strong="H6068"\w* \w from my cousin|strong="H1121"\w* \w Hanamel|strong="H2601"\w*, \w and I weighed out|strong="H8254"\w* \w seventeen|strong="H7651"\w* \w shekels|strong="H8255"\w* \w of silver|strong="H3701"\w*.\f + \fr 32:9 \fqa 17 shekels \ft is approximately 6.8 ounces or 193.8 grams of silver.\f* \v 10 \w I signed|strong="H3789"\w* \w and sealed|strong="H2856"\w* \w the deed|strong="H5612"\w*, \w called in witnesses|strong="H5749"\w*, \w and weighed out|strong="H8254"\w* \w the silver|strong="H3701"\w* \w on the scales|strong="H3976"\w*. \v 11 \w Then I took|strong="H3947"\w* \w the deed|strong="H5612"\w* \w of purchase|strong="H4736"\w*— \w the sealed|strong="H2856"\w* \w copy with its terms|strong="H4687"\w* \w and conditions|strong="H2706"\w*, \w as well as|strong="H853"\w* \w the open copy|strong="H1540"\w*— \v 12 \w and I gave|strong="H5414"\w* \w this deed|strong="H5612"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Baruch|strong="H1263"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Neriah|strong="H5374"\w*, \w the son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Mahseiah|strong="H4271"\w*, \w in the sight|strong="H5869"\w* \w of my cousin|strong="H1730"\w* \w Hanamel|strong="H2601"\w* \w and the witnesses|strong="H5707"\w* \w who were signing|strong="H3789"\w* \w the purchase|strong="H4736"\w* \w agreement|strong="H5612"\w* \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the Jews|strong="H3064"\w* \w sitting|strong="H3427"\w* \w in the courtyard|strong="H2691"\w* \w of the guard|strong="H4307"\w*.
\p \v 13 \w In their sight|strong="H5869"\w* \w I instructed|strong="H6680"\w* \w Baruch|strong="H1263"\w*, \v 14 “\w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w says|strong="H559"\w*: \w Take|strong="H3947"\w* \w these|strong="H428"\w* \w deeds|strong="H5612"\w*— \w both the sealed copy|strong="H2856"\w* \w and the|strong="H2088"\w* \w open|strong="H1540"\w* \w copy|strong="H5612"\w* \w of the|strong="H2088"\w* \w deed|strong="H5612"\w* \w of purchase|strong="H4736"\w*— \w and put them|strong="H5414"\w* \w in a clay|strong="H2789"\w* \w jar|strong="H3627"\w* \w to|strong="H4616"\w* \w preserve them|strong="H5975"\w* \w for a long|strong="H7227"\w* \w time|strong="H3117"\w*. \v 15 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w says|strong="H559"\w*: \w Houses|strong="H1004"\w*, \w fields|strong="H7704"\w*, \w and vineyards|strong="H3754"\w* \w will again|strong="H5750"\w* \w be bought|strong="H7069"\w* \w in this|strong="H2063"\w* \w land|strong="H776"\w*.”
\s1 Jeremiah Prays for Understanding
\p \v 16 \w After|strong="H310"\w* \w I had given|strong="H5414"\w* \w the deed|strong="H5612"\w* \w of purchase|strong="H4736"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Baruch|strong="H1263"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Neriah|strong="H5374"\w*, \w I prayed|strong="H6419"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*: \v 17 “\w Oh|strong="H162"\w*, \w Lord|strong="H136"\w* \w GOD|strong="H3069"\w*! \w You|strong="H859"\w* \w have made|strong="H6213"\w* \w the heavens|strong="H8064"\w* \w and the earth|strong="H776"\w* \w by Your great|strong="H1419"\w* \w power|strong="H3581"\w* \w and outstretched|strong="H5186"\w* \w arm|strong="H2220"\w*. \w Nothing|strong="H3808"\w* \w is too difficult|strong="H6381"\w* \w for You|strong="H4480"\w*!
\p \v 18 \w You show|strong="H6213"\w* \w loving devotion|strong="H2617"\w* \w to thousands|strong="H505"\w* \w but lay|strong="H7999"\w* \w the iniquity|strong="H5771"\w* \w of the fathers|strong="H1"\w* \w into|strong="H413"\w* \w the laps|strong="H2436"\w*\f + \fr 32:18 \ft Hebrew \fqa into the bosom\f* \w of their children|strong="H1121"\w* \w after them|strong="H310"\w*, \w O great|strong="H1419"\w* \w and mighty|strong="H1368"\w* \w God|strong="H410"\w* \w whose name|strong="H8034"\w* \w is the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*, \v 19 \w the One great|strong="H1419"\w* \w in counsel|strong="H6098"\w* \w and mighty|strong="H7227"\w* \w in deed|strong="H5950"\w*, \w whose|strong="H834"\w* \w eyes|strong="H5869"\w* \w are on|strong="H5921"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the ways|strong="H1870"\w* \w of the sons|strong="H1121"\w* \w of men|strong="H120"\w*, \w to reward|strong="H5414"\w* \w each one|strong="H376"\w* \w according to his ways|strong="H1870"\w* \w and according to the fruit|strong="H6529"\w* \w of his deeds|strong="H4611"\w*.
\p \v 20 \w You performed|strong="H7760"\w* \w signs|strong="H226"\w* \w and wonders|strong="H4159"\w* \w in the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H4714"\w*, \w and You do so to|strong="H5704"\w* \w this very|strong="H2088"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*, \w both in Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w and among all mankind|strong="H120"\w*. \w And You have made|strong="H6213"\w* \w a name|strong="H8034"\w* for Yourself, \w as is the case|strong="H2088"\w* \w to this day|strong="H3117"\w*.
\p \v 21 \w You brought|strong="H3318"\w* \w Your people|strong="H5971"\w* \w Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w out of the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H4714"\w* \w with signs|strong="H226"\w* \w and wonders|strong="H4159"\w*, \w with a strong|strong="H2389"\w* \w hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w and an outstretched|strong="H5186"\w* \w arm|strong="H248"\w*, \w and with great|strong="H1419"\w* \w terror|strong="H4172"\w*. \v 22 \w You gave|strong="H5414"\w* them \w this|strong="H2063"\w* \w land|strong="H776"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w You had sworn|strong="H7650"\w* \w to give|strong="H5414"\w* \w their fathers|strong="H1"\w*, \w a land|strong="H776"\w* \w flowing|strong="H2100"\w* \w with milk|strong="H2461"\w* \w and honey|strong="H1706"\w*.
