\c 33
\s1 The Excellence of the Restored Nation
\p \v 1 \w While Jeremiah|strong="H1931"\w* \w was still|strong="H5750"\w* \w confined|strong="H6113"\w* \w in the courtyard|strong="H2691"\w* \w of the guard|strong="H4307"\w*, \w the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w came|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w him|strong="H3414"\w* \w a second time|strong="H8145"\w*: \v 2 “\w Thus|strong="H3541"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w who made the earth|strong="H6213"\w*,\f + \fr 33:2 \ft LXX; Hebrew \fqa who made it\f* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w who formed|strong="H3335"\w* \w it|strong="H853"\w* \w and established it|strong="H3559"\w*, \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w is His name|strong="H8034"\w*: \v 3 \w Call|strong="H7121"\w* \w to Me|strong="H413"\w*, \w and I will answer|strong="H6030"\w* \w and show|strong="H5046"\w* you \w great|strong="H1419"\w* \w and unsearchable things|strong="H1219"\w* \w you do not|strong="H3808"\w* \w know|strong="H3045"\w*.
