\c 49
\s1 Judgment on the Ammonites
\q1 
\p \v 1 \w Concerning the Ammonites|strong="H1121"\w*, \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
\b 
