\s1 Judgment on Edom
\r (\ref Obadiah 1:1–14|OBA 1-14\ref*)
\p \v 7 \w Concerning Edom|strong="H123"\w*, \w this is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
\b 
