\c 51
\s1 Judgment on Babylon
\p \v 1 \w This is what|strong="H3541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w says|strong="H559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w Behold|strong="H2005"\w*, \w I will stir up|strong="H5782"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w Babylon|strong="H894"\w*
