\q1 \v 6 \w Flee|strong="H5127"\w* \w from|strong="H8432"\w* \w Babylon|strong="H894"\w*! \w Escape|strong="H4422"\w* \w with your|strong="H376"\w* \w lives|strong="H5315"\w*!
